        "tag": "title",
        "text": "International politics"
      },
      {
        "y": 70.7,
        "x0": 75.1,
        "x1": 182.1,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A United Nations"
      },
      {
        "y": 88.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 263.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The UN is an international organisation"
      },
      {
        "y": 99.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 299.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "constituted1 in 1945 to make the world a better"
      },
      {
        "y": 111.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 305.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "place for humanity2. From its foundation3, it has"
      },
      {
        "y": 123.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 205.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "pursued4 these key aims:"
      },
      {
        "y": 134.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 264.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "• To keep peace throughout the world."
      },
      {
        "y": 146.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 278,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "• To establish5 friendly relations between"
      },
      {
        "y": 160.6,
        "x0": 110.2,
        "x1": 151.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "countries."
      },
      {
        "y": 170.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 299.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "• To work together to improve people’s lives by"
      },
      {
        "y": 183.5,
        "x0": 110.2,
        "x1": 299.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "conquering6 poverty, disease, illiteracy7 and"
      },
      {
        "y": 196.6,
        "x0": 110.2,
        "x1": 300,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "environmental destruction, and to encourage"
      },
      {
        "y": 208.6,
        "x0": 110.2,
        "x1": 297.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "respect for each other’s rights and freedoms."
      },
      {
        "y": 218.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 275.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "• To be a centre for supporting nations in"
      },
      {
        "y": 232.6,
        "x0": 110.2,
        "x1": 202.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "achieving these goals."
      },
      {
        "y": 247.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 492.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "In other words, the UN stresses the importance of negotiation8 when there are disagreements"
      },
      {
        "y": 259.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 501.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "between countries. It is opposed to injustice9 and upholds10 the rights of minorities11 but it will"
      },
      {
        "y": 271.7,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 466,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "only support military intervention12 if its Security Council agrees that this is justified13."
      },
      {
        "y": 290.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 495.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 formed (used about an official organisation) 2 all people 3 time when it was established [founded]"
      },
      {
        "y": 302.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 499.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 try to achieve (pursue with this meaning collocates with words like aim, goal, career, strategy) 5 set up,"
      },
      {
        "y": 314.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 500.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "put in place 6 beating, getting rid of 7 inability to read or write 8 discussions in an attempt to reach"
      },
      {
        "y": 326.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 500.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "an agreement 9 unfairness 10 supports 11 groups of people who differ racially or in some other way"
      },
      {
        "y": 339.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 507.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "from most of the people in the place where they live (minority collocates with adjectives like ethnic, religious,"
      },
      {
        "y": 350.8,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 487.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "oppressed) 12 involvement in a difficult situation in order to improve it 13 caused by a good reason"
      },
      {
        "y": 371.8,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 212.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B Political movements"
      },
      {
        "y": 389.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 521.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A political movement is a group of people with the same beliefs who work together in the attempt to"
      },
      {
        "y": 401.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 515.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "achieve something. They often make use of a slogan, a short phrase that catches people’s attention"
      },
      {
        "y": 413.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 500.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "and is easy to remember. The aim of a political movement might be the liberation of a minority,"
      },
      {
        "y": 425.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 508.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "perhaps, or the integration of one particular social group into the society from which it is, or feels"
      },
      {
        "y": 437.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 502.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "itself to be, excluded. Members of a political movement sometimes go on a march, a walk where"
      },
      {
        "y": 449.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 464.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "they can demonstrate their solidarity with others sharing the same attitudes and aims."
      },
      {
        "y": 470.6,
        "x0": 75,
        "x1": 241.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "C International conferences"
      },
      {
        "y": 515.8,
        "x0": 113.9,
        "x1": 177.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "NEWS"
      },
      {
        "y": 544.6,
        "x0": 209.4,
        "x1": 511.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A major international conference is currently meeting in Rio. Delegates1"
      },
      {
        "y": 559,
        "x0": 209.3,
        "x1": 511.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "from 60 different countries are attending. Their aim is to determine"
      },
      {
        "y": 572,
        "x0": 209.3,
        "x1": 511.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "ways in which each country can minimise the energy requirements of"
      },
      {
        "y": 583.6,
        "x0": 209.3,
        "x1": 511.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "its infrastructure2, with a view to slowing the rate of global warming."
      },
      {
        "y": 596.6,
        "x0": 209.4,
        "x1": 511.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The governments of each country recognise3 the importance of these"
      },
      {
        "y": 609.6,
        "x0": 209.4,
        "x1": 511.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "discussions and have undertaken4 to support any programme of"
      },
      {
        "y": 624,
        "x0": 209.4,
        "x1": 511.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "measures agreed on by the conference. Although some of the issues"
      },
      {
        "y": 635.6,
        "x0": 209.4,
        "x1": 511.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "under discussion are undeniably5 delicate6, the conference has so far"
      },
      {
        "y": 648.6,
        "x0": 209.4,
        "x1": 455.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "shown more unity7 than is customary8 at such gatherings."
      },
      {
        "y": 677,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 493.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 representatives 2 basic systems and services such as transport 3 accept 4 promise 5 certainly"
      },
      {
        "y": 689,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 386.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 needing to be handled with great skill 7 being together as one 8 usual"
      }
